      "principle": "The burden lies on the husband to prove that the marriage was not consummated.",
      "held": "It is held that the burden lies on the husband to prove that the marriage was not consummated. The court has consistently taken the view that the burden of proof in such cases lies on the person who asserts non-consummation.",
